{"id":"level-up-2026-10-17","name":"2026-10-17 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1451","en":"The volunteers organised a public exhibition about animal welfare.","zh":"志愿者们组织了一场有关动物福利的公众展览。","note":"welfare · 福利 · animal welfare","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1452","en":"Watching the sunrise from the summit was a memorable experience.","zh":"在山顶看日出是一次难忘的经历。","note":"memorable · 容易记住的； 难忘的 · a memorable experience","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1453","en":"A legislative committee invited residents to discuss the proposed changes.","zh":"一个立法委员会邀请居民讨论拟议中的变革。","note":"legislative · 立法的，有立法权的；根据法规执行的；立法机关的；立法机关 · a legislative committee","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1454","en":"It took several hours to transcribe the entire recorded interview.","zh":"把整段访谈录音转录下来花了好几个小时。","note":"transcribe · 抄写， 誊写； 打印； 转录 · transcribe an interview","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1455","en":"A foul smell drifted from the bins behind the restaurant.","zh":"餐厅后面的垃圾桶飘出一阵恶臭。","note":"foul · 发臭的；肮脏的；邪恶的；犯规 · a foul smell","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1456","en":"These delicate plants flourish in shade beside the garden wall.","zh":"这些娇嫩的植物在花园墙边的阴凉处生长茂盛。","note":"flourish · 繁荣；茂盛；兴旺； · flourish in shade","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1457","en":"A retired astronaut answered questions during the school's science festival.","zh":"一位退休宇航员在学校科学节上回答了问题。","note":"astronaut · 宇航员 · a retired astronaut","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1458","en":"She began to contemplate a career change after moving home.","zh":"搬家后，她开始考虑换一个职业。","note":"contemplate · 思量， 沉思； 注视， 凝视； 打算， 预期 · contemplate a change","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1459","en":"A small fishing vessel entered