ation before asking questions.","zh":"提问之前，给学生时间消化这些信息。","note":"digest · 消化；领会['daɪdʒ3st]；文摘 · digest information","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1488","en":"He has an exceptional ability to explain complicated ideas simply.","zh":"他具有非凡的能力，能够把复杂的想法解释得简单明了。","note":"ability · 能力； 本领； 才能 · an exceptional ability","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1489","en":"Please arrive at least ten minutes before the concert begins.","zh":"请至少在音乐会开始前十分钟到达。","note":"at least · 至少 · at least","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1490","en":"The study challenged a common belief about how children learn.","zh":"这项研究挑战了一种关于儿童学习方式的普遍看法。","note":"belief · 信仰， 信条； 相信 · a common belief","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1491","en":"Exuberant celebrations filled the square after the team's unexpected victory.","zh":"球队意外获胜后，广场上充满了热烈的庆祝活动。","note":"exuberant · 繁茂的， 丰富的； 非凡的； 华而不实的 · exuberant celebrations","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1492","en":"The historian used immigration records to trace her family's journey.","zh":"这位历史学家利用移民记录追溯了家族的迁徙历程。","note":"immigration · 外来的移民； 移居 · immigration records","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1493","en":"We can halve the amount of sugar in this recipe.","zh":"我们可以把这个食谱中的糖量减半。","note":"halve · 二等分， 减半 · halve the amount","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1494","en":"A professor emeritus returned to campus for the anniversary lecture.","zh":"一位荣休教授回到校园参加周年纪念讲座。","note":"emeritus · 保留头衔而退休的， 荣誉退休的 · professor emeritus","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1495","en":"The flower bent gently on its long, slender stem.","zh":"这朵花在细长的茎上轻轻弯下了头。","note":"slender · 修长的， 细长的， 苗条的； 微小的， 微薄的 · a slender stem","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-17:s1496","en":"Their overlapping responsibilities occasionally caused confusion about who should respond.","zh":"他们的职责有所重叠，有时会让人弄不清谁该作出回应。","note":"overlap